cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: "ReCRATE: reuse published methods on your data, checked and recorded"
abstract: "Turns a paper, an RO-Crate or a WorkflowHub entry into an agent that runs the published methods on new data, compares the results with the published ones, and records every run as a Workflow Run RO-Crate."
message: "If you use ReCRATE, please cite it as below."
